<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IMC Global upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IMC Global upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Schroder Wertheim said it upgraded IMC Global Inc to outperform from perform.</p>
<p>- said it believed the phosphate and potash markets are poised for improvement.</p>
<p>- said it expects diammonium phosphate prices and margins to bottom out in December and begin improving in early 1997.</p>
<p>- said raw material ammonia prices appear firm heading into 1997 and sulfur prices have bottomed out.</p>
<p>- IMC's stock was up 1-3/8 to 36-1/4.</p>
</text>
